{"4302920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "War Drone", "steam_appid": 4302920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield has changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>War Drone</strong>, You are a drone operator tasked with disrupting enemy operations by eliminating infantry, armored units, and critical military infrastructure such as radar stations and anti-air defenses. Each drone has strengths and limitations use them wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map: The Valley, enemy targets covering the valley, your mission to scout out the enemies and cause disruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302920/extras/81fad51560fe1d758c30064caa4b9602.avif?t=1774428091\" width=800 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is simple: disrupt, disable, and destroy key enemy assets.<br>How you do it is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Example of a Drone with granades, another has armor plate below to take more shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302920/extras/2c9cd6e1eae5b377518923dfd83ab370.avif?t=1774428091\" width=256 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302920/extras/a55f9af15a43dd896c20a54f4db0a9ab.avif?t=1774428091\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right drone for the mission, manage altitude and speed, and strike with precision before defenses lock on. Some drones won’t survive longothers will become your most valuable assets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is allready a good selection of drone varity. Consider these drones as sponsored from supporters.<br>Hence the drones are really civilian drones with DIY modifications. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or maybe the smaller FPV drones, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302920/extras/4b3876fa382ce3e8dbe7718a64b59b6b.avif?t=1774428091\" width=256 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302920/extras/689dcd18dcd6e874b6469ba48da996b3.avif?t=1774428091\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the main campaign is completed, the openworld maps open up for play.<br>With random targets and on each load of the map, parts of the infrastruture change.<br>Nothing is the same, and this allows for a unique experience and completion of achivements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate the battlefield, and push back.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield has changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>War Drone</strong>, You are a drone operator tasked with disrupting enemy operations by eliminating infantry, armored units, and critical military infrastructure such as radar stations and anti-air defenses. Each drone has strengths and limitations use them wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map: The Valley, enemy targets covering the valley, your mission to scout out the enemies and cause disruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302920/extras/81fad51560fe1d758c30064caa4b9602.avif?t=1774428091\" width=800 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is simple: disrupt, disable, and destroy key enemy assets.<br>How you do it is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Example of a Drone with granades, another has armor plate below to take more shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302920/extras/2c9cd6e1eae5b377518923dfd83ab370.avif?t=1774428091\" width=256 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302920/extras/a55f9af15a43dd896c20a54f4db0a9ab.avif?t=1774428091\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right drone for the mission, manage altitude and speed, and strike with precision before defenses lock on. Some drones won’t survive longothers will become your most valuable assets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is allready a good selection of drone varity. Consider these drones as sponsored from supporters.<br>Hence the drones are really civilian drones with DIY modifications. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or maybe the smaller FPV drones, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302920/extras/4b3876fa382ce3e8dbe7718a64b59b6b.avif?t=1774428091\" width=256 height=256 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302920/extras/689dcd18dcd6e874b6469ba48da996b3.avif?t=1774428091\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the main campaign is completed, the openworld maps open up for play.<br>With random targets and on each load of the map, parts of the infrastruture change.<br>Nothing is the same, and this allows for a unique experience and completion of achivements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate the battlefield, and push back.</p>", "short_description": "Tactical drone combat against infantry, armor, and air defenses. Control advanced drones, strike high-value targets, and dominate the battlefield from anywhere, your call. War is no longer fought on the ground. Operate combat drones, destroy high-value targets, and survive hostile airspace.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302920/c35cfaa2b54abf06709687461529eddc35064b2a/header.jpg?t=1774428091", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302920/7d29cbbeac84defa5fe4d0761df8ce944d521f92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774428091", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302920/7d29cbbeac84defa5fe4d0761df8ce944d521f92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774428091", "website": "https://evisystems.org/games/war-drone/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1+), 10, or 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX11, or DX12-capable GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1+), 10, or 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX11, or DX12-capable GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Martin Vaupell Christensen"], "publishers": 